# RL training artifacts (rktl_simulator/rktl_simulator/train_ppo.py --out, evaluate.py)
# Checkpoints, final models and TensorBoard logs are reproducible from a training run and
# too large/frequent to version; keep them local or upload them elsewhere if you want to share one.
runs/
*.zip
events.out.tfevents.*